<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>L's</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Nemzzz</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DO NOT DISTURB (DELUXE)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4eIkgU9qfmwwPicaCRUI55</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.240" end="00:14.460">Yo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.460" end="00:16.690">All my L's they come with a V</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.690" end="00:19.180">Ayy, yo, she on that, "Fuck my ex"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.180" end="00:20.710">Got on Sexyy Red in the V</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.710" end="00:24.090">Know she'll get in her feelings if I put on some R&amp;B</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.090" end="00:25.660">If I put on that Jhené Aiko</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.660" end="00:27.640">I was broke thinking about Heathrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.640" end="00:29.140">When I take a flight, don't post</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.790" end="00:31.290">Gotta 444 on her, +44 on the contact</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.290" end="00:35.130">So many parties missed, now I can sip my cognac</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.130" end="00:38.500">Can't talk on me, I done made more than you and I still try top that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.500" end="00:41.060">I find it hard to manouvere, I'm on the M-way chasing dough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.060" end="00:44.900">My heart can't be on my sleeve unless it comes after Chrome</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.900" end="00:46.400">She wanna talk 'bout "when am I home?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.270" end="00:47.900">I'll let you know when I'm back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.900" end="00:50.640">Better than who? Bettеr than me? Gotta be smoking crack</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.640" end="00:54.700">Ayy, yo, all my L's they comе with a V</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.700" end="00:57.610">Ayy, yo, she on that, "Fuck my ex"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.610" end="00:59.110">Got on Sexyy Red in the V</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.090" end="01:02.210">Know she'll get in her feelings if I put on some R&amp;B</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.210" end="01:03.710">If I put on that Jhené Aiko</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.620" end="01:06.700">Yo, I need some brain, like, bae, "Let me see how you thinking"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.700" end="01:09.930">Me, I was sat there broke like you, seeing the clock just ticking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.930" end="01:13.150">I'm kinda bait, try be on low but they got a lot to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.150" end="01:16.300">Me I don't care about the opinions or the rumours made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.300" end="01:19.830">I don't wanna hit right now, I'm drained, and I still gotta make this play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.830" end="01:23.020">And, if bro don't feel your vibe, won't be me to ruin your day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.020" end="01:26.250">Females catting for me, moretime, don't even know my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.250" end="01:29.420">All they know is I'm making P, and they know I don't pick up the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.420" end="01:33.160">Ayy, yo, all my L's they come with a V</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.160" end="01:35.800">Ayy, yo, she on that, "Fuck my ex"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.800" end="01:37.390">Got on Sexyy Red in the V</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.390" end="01:40.550">Know she'll get in her feelings if I put on some R&amp;B</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.550" end="01:42.780">If I put on that Jhené Aiko</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.780" end="01:46.780" /></div></body></tt>